// camera: xyz forward, w light count; config: x signal bits (1 shadows, 2 GI, 4 reflections), yz size, w history valid;
// actor: x first, y count of the actor-shadow light records appended after the shading lights (render_policy::actor_shadow_lights),
// z SHADOW_ALPHA / 100; planar: xyz direction toward the planar shadow's light (render_policy::planar_light_direction),
// w 1 when the frame has SHADOW casters.
