// Model and vertex-lit receivers: visibility of the baked WMB lights that scene.frag adds per pixel (the model light loop,
// enhancedBaked) with the same falloff, against all geometry (the level, every model, the receiver itself), so a character
// is shadowed by its own limbs, by other actors and by the walls. The dominant light is traced every frame and one other in
// proportion to its contribution (it stands for all the others); the ratio scales the baked term.
